      "description": "The textual phrase 'the proper way to pop a blackhead' is juxtaposed with the visual of a woman performing the action. This creates an analogical mapping where the text labels the visual action as 'the proper way,' implying a methodological or idealized approach to blackhead extraction. The mapping is established through direct textual-visual alignment, where the text serves to define or categorize the visual scene.",
